evaluate_io_events_mono_typed=∀(exps :α stackLang$prog) (s1 :(α, β, γ) state) (res :α result option) (s2 :(α, β, γ) state). (evaluate (exps,s1) :α result option # (α, β, γ) state) = (res,s2) ⇒ s1.ffi.io_events ≼ s2.ffi.io_events
